<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<%# AI-ADDED: Privacy Policy page content. %>
<main class="legal-page">
  <header class="legal-hero">
    <div class="legal-eyebrow">Wanderlust · Your information</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      We want you to feel at home while exploring Wanderlust. This page explains
      what information this platform uses and how it supports your experience.
    </p>
    <span class="legal-updated">Last updated: October 21, 2026</span>
  </header>

  <div class="legal-content">
    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>
        When you create an account or use the platform, you may provide details
        such as your username, email address, listing information, photos, and
        reviews.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Information collected while using Wanderlust</h2>
      <p>
        The application uses session cookies to keep you signed in and support
        features such as account access and notices. Your browser may also send
        standard technical information when it requests a page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>How information is used</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To create and manage accounts and listings.</li>
        <li>To display listing details, photos, and reviews.</li>
        <li>To maintain site functionality and help protect the platform.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        Some features rely on third-party services configured for the
        application, including Cloudinary for listing images and Mapbox for
        location services. Their handling of information is governed by their
        own privacy policies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
      <p>
        Information you add to public listings or reviews may be visible to
        other visitors. Account and listing information is retained as needed
        to operate the application and its features.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>Your choices and questions</h2>
      <p>
        Avoid including sensitive personal information in public listing
        content or reviews. For questions about this policy or your information,
        contact the Wanderlust site administrator.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <aside class="legal-note">
    This policy is a general description of this project’s current features,
    not legal advice. Review and update it to match your actual deployment,
    data practices, and applicable laws before launching publicly.
  </aside>
</main>
